ak"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"雑炊です☺︎"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"...❁"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"キムチ鍋なら、チーズリゾットも美味しいですねԅ(¯﹃¯ԅ)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"⚫︎ 奈於っち様は言って欲しい告白ってありますか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"んーーー、昔話とかですかね？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも何でも嬉しいです！秘密な事でも、些細な〝実はね...〟の話でも☺︎話してくれるだけで嬉しいです(∩ˊᵕˋ∩)･*"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"⚫︎ 「ツインテール」「ハーフツイン」「ハーフアップ」の3つのゆみっきーがいたとします。僕はどのゆみっきーを好きになればいいですか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こりゃ難しいですね...！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"似合ってるかな？と思ってくださった髪型で☺︎笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"好きになっていただけるように頑張ります！( '-' )ง✧"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"⚫︎ だんだん寒くなってきましたが、今年の冬に最初に食べたいお鍋はなんですか？(^^)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"豆乳鍋∗•*¨*⸜(´ ˘ `∗)⸝*¨*•∗"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"⚫︎ ゆみっきーも昔から見るような夢はありますか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"小さな頃は、頭の先から爪先まで真っ黒の方がカーキのコートを着ていらっしゃる夢を見たら怖かった記憶があります！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"p